            add(new Label{Text=navigationOnly?"Apply one original navigation prephase on a separate copy. Only fleet16 has active navigation; policy and idle callbacks are dormant. Choose wait, replan or intermediate arrival. Gold stays fixed and no world clock runs.":"Build one recovered route cost field on a separate copy. Gold fleet and green destination stay fixed. Blockers and clock are supplied study inputs. This window does not travel along the route or run a world clock."},82);
